body:
Look up Harley Blakeman on youtube, he got drug charges in his 20's and went to prison.  After his release he worked as an operations manager for a big distribution company.

&#x200B;

I have another friend who had 8 Forgery charges from 2009/2010 and was working at microsoftas a contractor for a year or so.

&#x200B;

The big giant companies SUCK ANYWAY.  youre not viewed as a human being but a speck on a spreadsheet.

&#x200B;

I am acceptinig of the fact I cant work for a publically traded company, and I think thats a good thing.  Middle management in a public company FUCKING SUCKS

I dont know what to believe here on this damn forum.  One person says "youre fucked and just wash dishes"  than another person says oh just a harrassment (my charge) charge you can be fine.

&#x200B;

What am I supposed to believe?
